<section class="inner-sec">
  <div class="sec-eyebrow">How it works in a gym</div>
  <h2>Every inquiry answered, every tour booked</h2>
  <p class="lede">One receptionist covers the phone, the texts, the website, and the socials — and its whole job is turning interest into someone standing in your gym.</p>
  <div class="svc-grid">
    <div class="svc"><strong>Missed-call text-back</strong>A call you can't take instantly becomes a text conversation: "Sorry we missed you — want to come take a look?"</div>
    <div class="svc"><strong>Answers the usuals</strong>Rates, hours, day passes, class times, childcare, what's included, how contracts work — answered instantly, any hour.</div>
    <div class="svc"><strong>Books tours &amp; intro sessions</strong>Prospects get put straight onto your real calendar for a walkthrough, a free week, or a first session.</div>
    <div class="svc"><strong>Instagram &amp; Facebook DMs</strong>Every DM answered in minutes with real info and a booking link — not left until someone gets to the office.</div>
    <div class="svc"><strong>Website chat</strong>A chat bubble on your site that answers questions and captures the prospect's name and number before they bounce.</div>
    <div class="svc"><strong>Human handoff</strong>Billing disputes, injuries, anything the AI shouldn't touch gets flagged to your phone with a summary — you step in when it matters.</div>
  </div>
