    <h2>A member isn't one sale — it's a year of them</h2>
    <p>Most local businesses lose a single ticket to a missed call. A gym loses a recurring membership: every month that person would have paid, plus the friend they'd have brought. That's what makes an unanswered phone expensive here, and why the fix pays for itself faster than in almost any other trade.</p>
    <div class="proof-points">
